#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save To New Tree"
msgstr "Fipamọ́ Sí Igi Tuntun"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save To Branch"
msgstr "Fipamọ́ Sí Ẹ̀ka"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear All Graphs"
msgstr "Nu Gbogbo Àwọn Gíráàfù Kúrò"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "A Ti Fi Gíráàfù Kún QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s added to QuickTree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "A ti fi Gíráàfù %s kún QuickTree. Lọ sí ojú-ewé QuickTree láti gbé gbogbo Àwọn Gíráàfù sí Igi tuntun tàbí èyí tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "A Kò Fi Gíráàfù Kún QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s was NOT added to QuickTree as it's already there waiting to be placed on a Tree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "A KÒ fi Gíráàfù %s kún QuickTree nítorí pé ó ti wà níbẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀ tó ń dúró láti gbé e sórí Igi. Lọ sí ojú-ewé QuickTree láti gbé gbogbo Àwọn Gíráàfù sí Igi tuntun tàbí èyí tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Specified.  Not added to QuickTree"
msgstr "A Kò Tọ́ka Sí Gíráàfù. A kò fi kún QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "No Graph was added to QuickTree as no Graph was specified."
msgstr "A kò fi Gíráàfù kankan kún QuickTree nítorí a kò tọ́ka sí Gíráàfù kankan."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree."
msgstr "Tẹ 'Tẹ̀síwájú' láti Fi Igi yìí Kún Un."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Tree Name"
msgstr "Orúkọ Igi"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "New Tree"
msgstr "Igi Tuntun"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Branch Name"
msgstr "Orúkọ Ẹ̀ka"

#: quicktree.php setup.php
msgid "QuickTree"
msgstr "QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add To Branch"
msgstr "Fi Kún Ẹ̀ka"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Fagilé"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Tẹ̀síwájú"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree Branch."
msgstr "Tẹ 'Tẹ̀síwájú' láti Fi Ẹ̀ka Igi yìí Kún Un."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add to which Graph Tree?"
msgstr "Fi kún Igi Gíráàfù wo?"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has Created Tree and/or Branch and added Graphs"
msgstr "QuickTree ti Ṣẹ̀dá Igi àti/tàbí Ẹ̀ka ó sì ti fi Àwọn Gíráàfù kún un"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has no Graphs Queued"
msgstr "QuickTree kò ní Àwọn Gíráàfù Kankan Ní Ìlà"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Information/Directions"
msgstr "Ìfitónilétí/Ìtọ́sọ́nà"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "The Graphs below are Queue to be added to a Cacti Tree.  You may keep them here for as long as you like, or you can perform one of the following actions"
msgstr "Àwọn Gíráàfù tó wà nísàlẹ̀ wà ní ìlà láti fi kún Igi Cacti kan. O lè pa wọ́n mọ́ síbí fún ìgbà tó o bá fẹ́, tàbí kí o ṣe ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ wọ̀nyí"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection to a new Graph Tree so you can keep them for later and work on something new."
msgstr "Fipamọ́ yíyàn rẹ sí Igi Gíráàfù tuntun kí o lè pa wọ́n mọ́ fún ìgbà míràn kí o sì ṣiṣẹ́ lórí nǹkan tuntun."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection as a branch to an existing tree so that they appear in a specific section of an existing tree."
msgstr "Fipamọ́ yíyàn rẹ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹ̀ka sí igi tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ kí wọ́n lè hàn ní apá pàtó kan nínú igi tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear all graphs"
msgstr "Nu gbogbo àwọn gíráàfù kúrò"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Nu Àwọn Gíráàfù tó wà lórí ojú-ewé yìí kúrò nínú Ìlà Gíráàfù kí o lè ní QuickTree òfo tó ṣetán fún àwọn yíyàn tuntun"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "You can manage the individual graphs that appear here by clicking:"
msgstr "O lè ṣàkóso àwọn gíráàfù kọ̀ọ̀kan tó hàn níbí nípa títẹ:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Fi kún un"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph View Page"
msgstr "Ojú-ewé Ìwò Gíráàfù"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "This icon is next to a Graph on the %s tab."
msgstr "Àmì-àwòrán yìí wà lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ Gíráàfù kan lórí táàbù %s."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Pa rẹ́"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "This icon next to the Graphs below to remove them from the QuickTree Queue."
msgstr "Àmì-àwòrán yìí wà lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ Àwọn Gíráàfù tó wà nísàlẹ̀ láti yọ wọ́n kúrò nínú Ìlà QuickTree."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Àkíyèsí:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Adding, removing or clearing on this page does not affect any other parts of Cacti (only Creating/Saving does)"
msgstr "Fífikún, yíyọkúrò tàbí nínùkúrò lórí ojú-ewé yìí kò nípa lórí apá míràn kankan ti Cacti (Ṣíṣẹ̀dá/Fífipamọ́ nìkan ló ń nípa)"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìgbésẹ̀"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Remove This Graph From QuickTree"
msgstr "Yọ Gíráàfù Yìí Kúrò Nínú QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "No Graphs Added Yet"
msgstr "A Kò Tíì Fi Gíráàfù Kankan Kún Un"

